OL,3,GNEWSAFloating car heading out to sea
OL,4,Afor second trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amphibious car is set to go on a
OL,7,Fsecond cross-sea journey to raise money
OL,8,Ffor a marine ambulance.
OL,10,FPaul Phillips and Gary Ward are
OL,11,Fplanning to take the yellow Daihatsu
OL,12,Fvehicle they converted into a seaworthy
OL,13,Fvessel three miles (4.8km) across the
OL,14,Fwater from Guernsey to the car free
OL,15,Fisland of Herm in aid of the St John
OL,16,FAmbulance Flying Christine III.
OL,18,FThe pair, who volunteer for on the
OL,19,Fmarine ambulance, completed a nine-mile
OL,20,F(14.5km) journey from Guernsey to Sark
OL,21,Ftwo weeks ago and have already raised
OL,22,Fmore than #14,000.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
