OL,3,GNEWSAFloating car heading out to sea
OL,4,Afor second trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe car is due to leave the Old
OL,7,FLifeboat slipway on Castle Embankment
OL,8,Fat 11:00 BST with support boats and the
OL,9,FFlying Christine III joining them for
OL,10,Fthe crossing.
